      "writtenOn": "2026-01-15T06:57:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you help to resolve the workaround to let cs pin high with not calling fp_sensor_unlock,it will auto changed to low whether call fp_sensor_unlock or not.",
      "parentUuid": "22e382de_49acfa64",
      "revId": "2f0c74bf3165492155d6c471fcef17ec208e8503",
